<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Frost Mage DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 3. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Frost Mage DPS Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>In Phase 3, as usual more gear becomes available before you set foot inside a raid, though in this phase the quality of said items far outperforms what was expected. This is mainly because the item level of items in Phase 2 got buffed on release to keep <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> relevant in Phase 3. Due to this you can obtain 225 ilvl items from H++ (Titan Rune Beta Heroics) bosses, as well as 239 ilvl items and 245 ilvl weapons from a new currency obtained at the end of each Heroic - the <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a>. These were previously obtainable from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> Normal Mode and Hard Mode bosses respectively.<br/>
<br/>Because of these two systems, these new Pre-Raid sets are extremely strong, but hard to farm as they'll require a lot of <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> to obtain. Consider them more so guidelines on what to aim for than a set to try and obtain in its entirety.<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Hit </b>- Aim for 11% Hit Rating, with the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=29440/precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_ice_magicdamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Precision</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33193/misery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_misery.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33602/improved-faerie-fire">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_faeriefire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Improved Faerie Fire</span></a> you'll be Hit Capped at 17%</div></li></ul>
