<br/>
<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-bind-on-equip">Best Bind on Equip Items for Frost Mage DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>Some of these items are crafted, while others are raid drops that happen to be BoE and tradable. Because they can be quite expensive they're listed here as options if you're browsing the auction house for some high value items to upgrade your character faster and enter raids sooner.<br/>
<br/>Some of these are listed in pre-raid due to their staying power throughout the phase, namely the new 245 ilvl crafted chest which performs better than any chest from Phase 2, and the bracers which are within a 50dps range of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45446/grasps-of-reason">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grasps of Reason</span></a>. While the 232 ilvl crafted belt and boots are just very good value for their cost since they were 2nd BiS even in Phase 2.<br/>
<br/>The rest are optional and under-perform compared to the items mentioned above, but they can still fill in any gaps in your set, so there's value in that.<br/>
<br/>
