<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Asimov's Drape</span></a></td>
<td>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> - <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33350/mimiron">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mimiron</span></a> 10-Man and 25-Man</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
